# SPA UI & UX consistency

Before adding or changing React UI:

1. Read `_System_Core/004_SPA_Design_System.md` (colors, PageLayout, tokens)
2. Read `_System_Core/005_SPA_UX_Patterns.md` (modals, toasts, motion rules, **page guides**, **inventory role permissions**)
3. Check `_System_Core/generated/spa/151_Components_Index.md` for existing patterns on similar pages
4. **Inventory pages:** follow `.cursor/rules/inventory-roles-and-guides.mdc` — Guide = header button + modal; permissions from API; no costing links for non-executive

## Must follow

- **Colors:** use Tailwind semantic tokens (`bg-background`, `bg-primary`, `text-muted-foreground`) — not random hex in new code
- **Exec/inventory/CSR pages:** wrap in `PageLayout` unless POS full-screen
- **Fixed sidebar:** `PageLayout` shell is `h-dvh overflow-hidden` — only `<main>` scrolls; sidebar stays fixed (see [[fixes/page-layout-fixed-sidebar]]). Never `min-h-screen` on the layout shell
- **Centered content:** `PageLayout` centers header + body in `max-w-6xl mx-auto` by default (`contentWidth` prop for wide/full). Do not add redundant `max-w-*` on page roots — see [[fixes/page-layout-centered-content]]
- **Scrollbars:** all `overflow-y-auto` / `overflow-auto` get Pyx slim thumb (fade on hover/scroll); sidebar uses `pyx-scroll-dark`; opt out with `no-pyx-scroll` only when necessary ([[fixes/pyx-scrollbars]])
- **Modals:** always use `AppModal` (+ Header/Body/Footer) from `components/AppModal.tsx`; see `.cursor/rules/app-modal.mdc`. `FulfillmentModal` is an alias. POS uses `POSModal`. Never new inline `fixed inset-0` dialogs.
- **Motion:** import from `motion/react`; always use `useReducedMotion()` and disable animation when true
- **Feedback animations:** every new feature gets toast/banner/step motion on success and error — use `onlineFulfillmentMotion.tsx` (CSR/fulfillment) or `orderRemarksMotion.tsx` / `posMotion.tsx` by domain
- **Hover affordance:** clickable rows, cards, and buttons must show highlight + drop shadow on hover — use `FulfillmentTableRow`, `FulfillmentPickerCard`, `FulfillmentPressable`, or exported `fulfillmentHover*` classes
- **API calls:** use `app/src/app/lib/api.ts` helpers; see `_System_Core/generated/140_Frontend_API_Clients.md`
- **Page guides:** muted border **Guide** in `PageLayout` actions → `*GuideModal` (closed by default); never inline accordion on page body — see `CostingGuideModal`, `PackagingInventoryGuideModal`

Auto maps: `_System_Core/generated/spa/` (routes, theme, motion exports)
